            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": null
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "PROBLEM 2A-2O SHOCK RESPONSE SPECTRA ",
            "block_bbox": [
                325,
                283,
                877,
                304
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Problem:Construct the elastic shock response spectra for the interior components of an above ground structure subject to an external explosion.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                342,
                996,
                419
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Procedure:",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                435,
                263,
                457
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 1.Determine maximum acceleration, velocity and displacement due to ground shock according to procedure outlined in Problem 2A-18.",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                480,
                1058,
                529
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 2.Determine maximum acceleration, velocity and displacement due to air shock according to the procedure outlined in Problems 2A-10 and 2A-19.",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                551,
                1032,
                601
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 3.Determine if the ground shock is outrunning or superseismic (Section 223.2). For outrunning ground shock the maximum values of displacement,velocity and acceleration in horizontal and vertical directions are the algebraic summation of the maximum motions from Steps 1 and 2.Otherwise proceed to Step 4.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                622,
                1042,
                752
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 4.For superseismic ground shock the maximum values of displacement,velocity and acceleration are the numerically larger values of direct-induced ground shock or the algebraic sum of the maximum motions from air shock and airburst induced ground shock.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                773,
                1057,
                877
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 5.Calculate the magnitude of acceleration, velocity and displacement for response spectra in horizontal and vertical directions by multiplying the maximum values of motions from Step 3 or Step 4 by their appropriate factor from Section 2-24.3.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                897,
                1009,
                1001
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 6.Draw the horizontal and vertical shock response spectras.",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                1023,
                876,
                1047
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "footer",
            "block_content": "2A-108",
            "block_bbox": [
                569,
                1484,
                645,
                1505
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": null
        }
    ],
